OL,3,ASurging fuel prices push UK inflation
OL,4,Arate to 3.5% ahead of Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pace of UK price rises accelerated
OL,7,Fahead of Chancellor John Healey's first
OL,8,FBudget, pushed up by sharp increases in
OL,9,Fpetrol and diesel prices.
OL,11,FThe rate of inflation rose to 3.5% from
OL,12,F3.1% in the year to September, its
OL,13,Fquickest pace since October 2025,
OL,14,Faccording to the Office for National
OL,15,FStatistics (ONS).
OL,17,FThe cost of filling up a vehicle has
OL,18,Fsoared in recent months as conflicts in
OL,19,Fthe Middle East and Europe continue to
OL,20,Fsqueeze global oil supplies.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,111,105,200,300,0,100
