OL,3,ASurging fuel prices push UK inflation
OL,4,Arate to 3.5% ahead of Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inflation figures came as UK
OL,7,Fgovernment borrowing jumped to nearly
OL,8,F#25bn in September, adding to pressure
OL,9,Fon Healey as he gears up for the
OL,10,FBudget.
